cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use QM-LUX in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "QM-LUX: Quantum Molecular Learning with predicted UV-Vis for Xenotoxicity"
abstract: >-
  QM-LUX predicts the phototoxicity of small molecules using UV-Vis spectra
  computed with quantum mechanics. The workflow combines 3D conformer generation
  (RDKit MMFF94s), conformational sampling with CREST/XTB, excited-state TD-DFT
  calculations with Gaussian, and an ML classifier trained on UV-Vis AUC
  descriptors, Morgan fingerprints, and RDKit physicochemical properties.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/bedapub/QM-LUX"
url: "https://github.com/bedapub/QM-LUX"
keywords:
